  "notes": "Solution is a transceiver pair: SO-SFP-1000BASE-BX120D-5157 (nominal Tx/Rx 1510nm/1570nm; footnote 1 transmitter 1504–1517nm, receiver wavelength 1550–1590nm) and SO-SFP-1000BASE-BX120D-5751 (nominal Tx/Rx 1570nm/1510nm; footnote 2 transmitter 1564–1577nm, receiver 1490–1530nm). Extended operating temperature -20°C to +85°C (-E ordering codes). Storage temperature -40°C to +85°C. Power budget 13 – 33dB. Dispersion penalty Max 1dB. Receiver minimum input power and overload measured @ 1.25Gbps, BER ≤ 1x10-12, PRBS 27-1, back-to-back (footnote 4). Output power and receiver levels are average power (footnote 3). Overview states bridgeable distance up to 160km; technical data typical reach 120km.",
